  "helpTitle": "Complete Guide",
  "helpSectionCoreTitle": "Core Mechanics: Dark Age System",
  "helpCoreLogicTitle": "Dice Logic (Mastery and Proficiency)",
  "helpCoreLogicDesc": "Instead of adding points to dice, the character's skill level (Novice, Trained, Master) and Proficiency level (I, II, III...) determine the *type* of dice rolled. Every 5 points in an attribute or skill grants one die, with the type determined by the highest achieved level (Novice -> d12, Trained/Master -> d20, PI -> d30, etc.). Points 1-4 grant progressively better dice within that scale.",
  "helpMaestriaTitle": "Skill Mastery (Novice, Trained, Master)",
  "helpMaestriaDesc": "• Novice: Base level, rolls d4-d10, closes a d12 every 5 points.\n• Trained (T): Increased dice scale (d6-d12), closes a d20 every 5 points.\n• Master (M): Same dice as Trained, but adds a massive fixed bonus equal to the skill/attribute value to the roll AND unlocks Proficiency.",
  "helpProficienciaTitle": "Proficiency (I, II, III...)",
  "helpProficienciaDesc": "An advanced upgrade purchased with 'Proficiency Points' (P) after reaching Master. Each level (I, II, III...) increases the dice scale further (closing d30, d40, d50...) and provides a small passive percentage bonus (+10% per level) to the base value.",
  "helpSectionCombatTitle": "Combat: Weapon Mastery & Critical Injuries",
  "helpWeaponMaestriaTitle": "Weapon Mastery (Level 0-4)",
  "helpWeaponMaestriaDesc": "Each weapon type has a unique mastery tree (Level 0-4) that improves its stats (Hit Chance, Critical Chance/Damage, Scaling) and grants a powerful special ability at Level 4, often enhancing the Critical Injury system.",
  "helpFerimentosTitle": "Critical Injuries",
  "helpFerimentosDesc": "Critical hits (based on a d100 roll vs the weapon's critical base) that exceed a certain percentage of the target's current or total HP trigger a devastating effect based on the damage type. The target must succeed on a Vigor check (DC = Damage Received) to mitigate the effect.",
  "helpFerimentosCortante": "Cutting (Amputation)",
  "helpFerimentosCortanteDesc": "Threshold: >50% current HP or >40% total HP. Failure on Vigor check results in limb amputation.",
  "helpFerimentosPerfurante": "Piercing (Organ Damage)",
  "helpFerimentosPerfuranteDesc": "Threshold: >40% current HP or >25% total HP. Failure on Vigor check results in specific organ damage (lung, heart, etc.).",
  "helpFerimentosImpacto": "Impact (Fractures/Trauma)",
  "helpFerimentosImpactoDesc": "Threshold: >60% current HP or >25% total HP. Failure on Vigor check results in broken bones, concussion, or paralysis.",
  "helpFerimentosDilacerante": "Tearing (Mutilation)",
  "helpFerimentosDilaceranteDesc": "Threshold: >50% current HP or >20% total HP. Failure on Vigor check results in severe bleeding, torn tendons, or mutilation.",
